[0.032, "o", "# START HERE\r\n\r\nTern is an open-source, self-hosted photo library, and this note is the entry point to its engineering notes.\r\n\r\nrelevant:\r\n- Backups: Tern backs up the database and the originals every night, and the backups can be restored on a fresh server.\r\n- Search index: The search index lets people find photos by caption, place, date and the objects detected in them.\r\n\r\nlinter: overdue=0 dangling=0\r\n"]
[7.013, "o", "\r\n# Packs are checked, reviewed in a fresh context, then copied into the workspace.\r\n"]
[3.012, "o", "$ hippocamp packs"]
[0.000, "o", " check"]
